# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — autotools config.status mktemp 沙箱限制 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-08-27
# Software: dpkg 1.23.7 / commoncpp2 1.8.1 / libdebian-installer 0.121
# Gate: W0/build (configure→config.status)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-autotools-config-status-mktemp
                        (extends E136/E167/E060; corroborates E223)
                        # 同族既有条目：E136/E167/E060（正式收录）、E223（草稿）
                        # 差异化增量：①精确替换点（带引号完整串 'mktemp -d "./confXXXXXX"'
                        #   ——E136 的 sed 正则无法命中无引号/不完整形式，实测踩坑）
                        # ②沙箱可写目录实测路径 /data/storage/el2/base/cache
                        # ③三库实证（dpkg/commoncpp2/libdebian-installer）——详见
                        #   docs/skills/autotools-config-status-mktemp-sandbox.md
severity: 2
category: build|autotools|sandbox
trigger_tool: conan|configure|config.status|mktemp
phase: build (configure→config.status)
approach: TMPDIR 指到沙箱可写目录（/data/storage/el2/base/cache——/tmp 只读、$HOME/.ci_logs 也
  Permission denied 实测）+ configure 的 mktemp 模板改 ${TMPDIR}/confXXXXXX（准确替换点必须是
  带引号的完整串 'mktemp -d "./confXXXXXX"'——无引号/不完整替换不命中）

keywords: config.status, mktemp, Permission denied, subs1.awk, autotools, configure,
  TMPDIR, OHOS, 鸿蒙, 沙箱, confXXXXXX

error_signature: config\.status: line \d+: \.\/conf[^/]*\/subs1\.awk: Permission denied|
  config\.status: error: could not setup config files machinery|
  mktemp: Failed to create file .*: Read-only file system
match_keywords: config.status, mktemp, Permission denied, subs1.awk, confXXXXXX, could not setup

root_cause: 鸿蒙沙箱 /tmp 只读（mktemp 默认写 /tmp）；$HOME/.ci_logs 写入也 Permission denied；
  autoconf 生成的 configure/config.status 用相对路径 mktemp（mktemp -d "./confXXXXXX"）——
  在沙箱当前目录（conan 构建目录）写入被拒；仅设置 TMPDIR 不够（相对路径不随 TMPDIR）

affected_scope: 所有在鸿蒙 PC 沙箱下用 autotools（configure+config.status）构建的三方库
  （dpkg/commoncpp2/libdebian-installer 三库实测——bitlbee/psfex 等同样可能命中）

rec_priority: 1
